<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a first tranche of October 31, 1998 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Oct 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.75 pct   vs    6.00 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.55 pct   vs    6.98 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  88.10	 vs   88.00</p>
<p>Bids			8.28 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.00 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a seventh tranche of August 31, 1998 Ctzs on October 10.</p>
</text>
